<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 19-FEB.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 19-FEB.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Harold, with 65 mph winds, is in the Coral Sea, east of Queensland, Australia, near 19s/158.0e, moving east-southeast at 10 mph. Harold is expected to continue this movement during the period. This system is mainly a risk to shipping but could pass just south of New Caledonia later in the period brushing the region with showers and high waves.</p>
</text>
